ore both her and  falco were subdued  by the survey corps in the aftermath of  sasha's death  both falco and gabby were captured and  taken to parodies  as prisoners my earliest memories of  sasha are of a funny and carefree girl  who absolutely  loves food so much so that she is  willing to risk  severe punishment for just a single  delicious potato  sasha was always a special and extremely  memorable character in attack on titan  precisely because she provides comic  relief in an  otherwise extremely bleak and cruel  world  in fact according to the attack on titan  character encyclopedia the creator of  attack on titan hajime isayama  apparently named sasha after the  comedian sasha baron cohen  you know that borat guy so isayama  always intended for sasha to be a comic  relief character  at least at first but as the story  progressed  sasha's character became much more than  just a meme  she became more complex more interesting  and much more developed isayama  initially wanted to kill  sasha off way back in volume 9 of the  story but his  editor convinced him to change his mind  by that point  sasha had become a fan favorite and it  was clear that her character had  amazing potential in terms of her  backstory  sasha grew up in a small village inside  wal rose that was overwhelmed by  newcomers  after the fall of wal-maria because the  villagers relied on hunting to survive  their way of life was quickly turned  upside down as the supply of wildlife  could not support  both the native villagers and the  refugees from wall maria  sasha was initially extremely upset by  this and she did not want to change her  traditional way of life for the sake of  accommodating the newcomers  in fact sasha got into an argument with  her father  after her father decided that helping  people was more important than  preserving their way of life  sasha's father concluded that the  villagers should switch focus from  hunting to farming  because farming was a more efficient way  to 